  "createbigcannons.ponder.munitions/using_autocannon_ammo_container.header": "ɹǝuıɐʇuoƆ oɯɯⱯ uouuɐɔoʇnⱯ ǝɥʇ buıs∩",
  "createbigcannons.ponder.munitions/using_autocannon_ammo_container.text_1": "˙suouuɐɔoʇnɐ pɐoן oʇ puɐ oɯɯɐ uouuɐɔoʇnɐ ǝɹoʇs oʇ ʎɐʍ ʇuǝıuǝʌuoɔ ɐ ǝɹɐ sɹǝuıɐʇuoƆ oɯɯⱯ uouuɐɔoʇnⱯ",
